       "bead": "S02-B4"
      },
      {
       "text": "第二次努力相信",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S02-B4"
       ],
       "bead": "S02-B4"
      },
      {
       "text": "第三次更显在意",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S02-B4"
       ],
       "bead": "S02-B4"
      },
      {
       "text": "悲伤还在心底",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S02-B4"
       ],
       "bead": "S02-B4"
      },
      {
       "text": "不肯交给悲伤",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S02-B4"
       ],
       "bead": "S02-B4"
      },
      {
       "text": "不甘心就这样消亡",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S02-B5"
