      {
       "text": "微风轻轻吹过",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S03-B2"
       ],
       "bead": "S03-B2"
      },
      {
       "text": "曾经亲近不设防",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S03-B2"
       ],
       "bead": "S03-B2"
      },
      {
       "text": "越温柔越刺痛",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S03-B2"
       ],
       "bead": "S03-B2"
      },
      {
       "text": "回忆和眼前隔很远",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S03-B2"
       ],
       "bead": "S03-B2"
      },
      {
       "text": "侧身离开重问题",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S03-B3"
       ],
       "bead": "S03-B3"
      },
      {
       "text": "像聊点别的",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S03-B3"
       ],
       "bead": "S03-B3"
      },
      {
       "text": "或出去走走",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S03-B3"
       ],
       "bead": "S03-B3"
      },
      {
       "text": "那一刻轻松是真的",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S03-B3"
       ],
       "bead": "S03-B3"
      },
      {
       "text": "却没替心事解答",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S03-B3"
       ],
       "bead": "S03-B3"
      },
      {
       "text": "重心像流沙抓不住",
       "keys": [],
